The FUTO Student Portal (portal.futo.edu.ng) is the university’s web-based academic and administrative platform. It serves three primary user groups: undergraduate and postgraduate students, academic staff (lecturers and advisers), and administrative units (Registry, Bursary, ICT). The database must support the following core operations, drawn from the portal’s documented process flows:

a. Course registration for a session and semester, including elective selection and credit-unit
   tracking.

b. Result entry and result checking, with GPA and CGPA computation on a 5.00 scale (A = 5, B = 4,
   C = 3, etc.).

c. Fee payment and receipt generation through an invoice–RRR–bank–receipt cycle.

d. Transcript application and academic record retrieval.

e. Profile and bio-data management,including department, programme, and departmental level.